platform marks in this folder

apple.svg: simple-icons (https://simpleicons.org), cc0 1.0
windows.svg, linux.svg, android.svg: gilbarbara/logos (https://github.com/gilbarbara/logos), cc0 1.0

the marks themselves are trademarks of their owners and are used only to name the platforms madani bot runs on.

linux-mono.svg, android-mono.svg: simple-icons (https://simpleicons.org), cc0 1.0, single colour for the hero pill
windows-mono.svg: windows.svg with its fill dropped, so it takes the text colour
